Z||000028||Songman||08-25-2001||04:50 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Mach10:<BR><B>PPE = Purple Pavement Eater. One of the more famous (to the fiero enthusiasts) fieros around. You can find pics of it here:<BR> <A HREF="http://www.v8archie.com/warberfs.htm" TARGET=_blank>http://www.v8archie.com/warberfs.htm</A> <P>I hope Archie doesn' mind me referencing his site...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>No offense to the builder but I personally don't like this car... and it is constantly for sale so I must not be alone...<P>Fiero bolt pattern is 5x100. You can do a search here on the forum and find out what stock wheels from other cars will fit on a Fiero.<P><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
